1), and الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0 (17). The first review item is Doliprane 1000mg tablets, with a size difference between the requested and the stored package (15 vs 60 tablets).\n\n\nExamining the detailed discrepancies in the remaining \"review\" cases reveals pack size as the consistent differentiating factor. \"Genuphil\", \"Triplixam\", and \"Averocoxib\" discrepancies are all due to differing tablet counts. \"Averocoxib\" also shows inventory entry inconsistencies (single tablets vs. standard pack sizes). \"Dancet\" shows a vial count difference. These observations inform a targeted refinement to the matching algorithm.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(r'data/processes/PROC-001/results_PROC-001.xlsx', data_only=True)\nfor sheet in wb.sheetnames:\n    if sheet not in ['ملخص', 'لم يُعثر عليه', 'يحتاج مراجعة']:\n        ws = wb[sheet]\n        rows = list(ws.iter_rows(values_only=True))[1:]\n        print(f\"\\n==================== {sheet} ({len(rows)} matches) ====================\")\n        for i, r in enumerate(rows, 1):\n            print(f\"{i:2d}. المطلوب: '{r[0]}'  <===>  المخزن: '{r[1]}' [{r[2]}]\")\n","Description":"Print all 72 matches across all warehouse sheets","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\scratch\\print_all_72_matches.py","toolAction":"Write print script","toolSummary":"Print all 72 matches"}}]}
